---
// The research page collects the research map and will later hold papers and projects.
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,650;0,700;1,400&amp;family=STIX+Two+Text:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&amp;display=swap"
    />
    <title>Research | Suraj Dash</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page-shell">
      <nav class="top-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a aria-current="page" href="/research">Research</a>
        <a href="/teaching">Teaching</a>
        <a href="/learning-seminars">Learning seminars</a>
        <a href="/travel">Travel</a>
      </nav>

    

      <section class="research-layout" aria-label="Research overview">
        <div class="publications">
          <article class="publication-card">
            <h2>Preprints</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Drafts on logarithmic Hilbert schemes and wall-crossing phenomena are in preparation.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>

         

          <article class="publication-card">
            <h2>Theses</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>
                <strong>Master thesis:</strong> Logarithmic construction of the moduli space of admissible covers (Università degli Studi di Padova, 2021).
              </li>
              <li>
                <strong>PhD thesis:</strong> GIT wall-crossings in logarithmic Hilbert schemes and applications
            </ul>
          </article>

          <article class="publication-card">
            <h2>Other writings</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Seminar notes and short expository pieces on logarithmic geometry and degenerations.</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>

        <aside class="research-map" aria-label="Research theme diagram">
          <div class="diagram">
            <span class="node node-top">Motivic<br />Invariants</span>
            <span class="node node-left">Expanded<br />Degenerations</span>
            <span class="node node-center">Log Hilbert<br />Schemes</span>
            <span class="node node-right">VGIT<br />Wall-Crossing</span>
            <span class="line line-horizontal"></span>
            <span class="line line-vertical"></span>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(:root) {
    --bg: #dfeaf0;
    --surface: #fffaf2;
    --text: #24313a;
    --heading: #304957;
    --muted: #4d606c;
    --accent: #98403a;
    --link: #316276;
    --line: rgba(43, 68, 82, 0.22);
    --map-surface: #c7dce6;
    --map-line: #607e8d;
    --diagram-grid: rgba(43, 68, 82, 0.1);
    --diagram-connector: #587d8e;
  }

  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: "DM Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(58, 103, 127, 0.1), transparent 34rem), var(--bg);
  }
  :global(p) { color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; }
  :global(a) { color: var(--link); text-decoration-thickness: .08em; text-underline-offset: .16em; }
  :global(strong) { font-weight: 650; }
  h1 { font-family: "STIX Two Text", Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; color: var(--heading); }
  h2, h3 { font-family: "DM Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; color: var(--heading); }
  .page-shell { width: min(1100px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 0 72px; }
  .top-nav { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 20px; padding: 12px 0 56px; font-family: "DM Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: .95rem; }
  .top-nav a { color: var(--link); text-decoration: none; }
  .top-nav a:hover, .top-nav a[aria-current='page'] { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--accent); }
  .page-heading { max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  .section-label { margin: 0 0 14px; font-family: "DM Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7.5rem); font-weight: 500; line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.045em; color: var(--heading); }
  .page-heading > p:last-child { margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text); }

  .research-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(320px, 0.75fr);
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .publications { display: grid; gap: 18px; max-width: 680px; }

  .publication-card {
    padding: 22px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 36px rgba(36, 49, 58, .07);
  }

  .publication-card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--heading);
  }

  .publication-card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .publication-card li { padding-left: 4px; }

  .research-map {
    padding: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--map-line);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: var(--map-surface);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(36, 49, 58, .09);
    position: sticky;
    top: 24px;
  }

  .diagram { position: relative; min-height: 380px; border-radius: 20px; background: linear-gradient(var(--diagram-grid) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, var(--diagram-grid) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 38px 38px; overflow: hidden; }
  .node { position: absolute; z-index: 2; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 150px; height: 88px; border: 1px solid var(--map-line); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--surface); box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(36, 49, 58, .10); text-align: center; font-family: "DM Sans", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-weight: 650; color: var(--heading); }
  .node-top { top: 42px; left: calc(50% - 75px); }
  .node-left { left: 9%; top: 230px; }
  .node-center { left: calc(50% - 75px); top: 230px; }
  .node-right { right: 9%; top: 230px; }
  .line { position: absolute; z-index: 1; background: var(--diagram-connector); }
  .line-horizontal { left: 18%; right: 18%; top: 274px; height: 2px; }
  .line-vertical { width: 2px; height: 125px; left: calc(50% - 1px); top: 124px; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .research-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .research-map { position: static; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    h1 { font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 16vw, 4.5rem); }
    .top-nav { justify-content: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-bottom: 42px; }
    .research-map { padding: 16px; }
    .diagram { min-height: 510px; }
    .node-top { top: 34px; }
    .node-left { left: calc(50% - 75px); top: 180px; }
    .node-center { top: 300px; }
    .node-right { right: auto; left: calc(50% - 75px); top: 420px; }
    .line-horizontal { display: none; }
    .line-vertical { height: 330px; top: 122px; }
  }
</style>
